guide_notes = "Armoured skeletons with real weight behind them - chip through the armour rather than trading blows. The Necromancer roams this ground too: a genuine T50 test on a four-minute respawn. Expect a long fight and telegraphed death magic — still the largest single Slayer payout on the table if you can take him."
location_hint = "Desert, The Sunken Tombs"
